<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Venter cautions again it in talks.</title>
<headline>Venter cautions again it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venter Leisure and Commercial Trailers Ltd said on Monday, referring to earlier cautioneries, that events and negotiations that could still take place would have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
